			"notes": "## Bugfixes\n- Doors and trapdoors can now all be broken by an axe or pickaxe (whichever is appropriate).\n- Fix #7 (Iron doors now work properly with https://github.com/Sollace/Presence-Footsteps).\n- Fixed tags (shouldn't impact gameplay).\n\n## Changes\n- Bumped fabric loader requirement to `0.12.12`.\n- Cleaned up code.\n\n## Notes\n- Removed crimson & warped glass doors & trapdoors (present in the betas). Will bring them back once I have textures for them.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ReviversMC/modern-glass-doors/compare/v2.0.0-1.18...v2.1.0+1.18\n\nSee this release on [CurseForge](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-glass-doors/files/3652303)."
